          "literal": {
            "prompt": "Какое натуральное текстильное волокно особенно известно характерным блеском?",
            "answers": [
              "Шёлк",
              "Хлопок",
              "Шерсть",
              "Лён"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 0
          },
          "literalSHA256": "ccba1840ecbf6a8a2d8ebe55bb9b1b503350f0ca8c556c7977009a611b570940",
          "primaryGround": "Merriam-Webster describes silk as especially lustrous, tough and elastic and used for textiles. The chosen MAIN asks for the familiar sheen property, not the cocoon origin already tested elsewhere.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion31/mw-silk.json"
